e whole discussion in this chapter back to the classical case.\nBut, if <MATH_0017> is inseparable, then an initial object does not\nexist.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4b6fffefc4862ff92c2303cc4f15904cc624535e27bca37ee2691eafa059daaf", "unit_id": "tag:06GV:prose-0004"}
